==Havering council elections since 2022==
There was a revision of ward boundaries in Havering in 2022. The ward lost territory to [[Gooshays (ward)|Gooshays]] and [[Heaton (Havering ward)|Heaton]], and gained territory from [[Cranham (ward)|Cranham]] and [[Emerson Park (ward)|Emerson Park]]. 

